%% System L7: inbound gate detail (pipe order) — eng / ops
%% Complements L5 (containers) and L6 (agent path). Keep labels short for mermaid.ink.
flowchart TB
  IN[Inbound WA event] --> MM{KASIR_MULTIMODAL?}
  MM -->|OFF + media| REF[Send refuse teks<br/>skip agent]
  MM -->|ON + media| GV[Gateway STT / vision<br/>stt.id + image_input auto]
  MM -->|text| AL{Allowlist?}
  GV --> AL
  AL -->|No + REG=1| REG[DAFTAR wizard]
  AL -->|No + REG=0| SKIP[Silent skip]
  AL -->|Yes| ST[Stamp sender<br/>map per chat v2]
  ST --> AG[Hermes agent<br/>SOUL + kasir-tools]
  AG --> TOOLS{SOUL route}
  TOOLS -->|cek stok| T1[kasir_get_stock]
  TOOLS -->|jual / satu lagi| T2[draft → poll → confirm]
  TOOLS -->|foto / voice ON| T2
  TOOLS -->|laporan| T3[period compiler<br/>→ kasir_period_report RPC]
  TOOLS -->|tutup toko| T4[kasir_tutup_toko]
  T1 --> DB[(Supabase)]
  T2 --> DB
  T3 --> DB
  T4 --> DB
